            "review_title": "Review at The 6ix - Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Stefan\nHamilton, Canada127 contributions\n0\nA little taste of Ossington in District 2\nJul 2024 • Couples\nCame upon this unexpectedly while strolling through District 2, so as Canadians we felt obliged to check it out. It has a nice chill vibe, a good cocktail menu (I had a great single malt), and the complementary popcorn and decor/music made me feel like I was on Ossington or W Queen West. A couple more Canadian whiskeys couldn’t hurt the menu, but we would happily return next time we’re in HCMC.\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2024",
