            "review_title": "Review at The 6ix - Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Peter A\n15 contributions\n0\nThe 6ix is the coolest bar in HCMC\nFeb 2024 • Solo\nIn 2018 there was another music venue in the Xûan Thûy Street of Thao Dien, which I always enjoyed frequenting very much. Unfortunately, it disappeared without a trace. For this there is now the 6ix, according to some reviewers the coolest bar in Saigon. Every Tuesday, Friday and Saturday a group plays good music there. And every time only a handful of people came. I find it really sad that such a great institution as the 6ix Bar, which offers superb drinks, gives everyone a bowl of popcorn for free and - also for free - organizes great live music, finds so little response. Probably it's just because the bar is not up near the main street, but is quite in the middle of Thao Dien. Guys, are you really so lazy that you shy away from the few meters? You're really missing something! The 6ix Bar is the coolest bar in HCMC!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nSimply enjoy the great vibes!\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 3, 2024",
