            "review_text": "edgewater12345\nperth191 contributions\n0\nQuaint Cocktail Bar\nAug 2023 • Solo\nI stumbled across the most beautiful and quaint Cocktail bar in district 2 HCMC.\nI was lucky enough to attend during the bars Happy Hours between 5.30 pm and 8pm.\nThe 2 guys at the bar served the most delicious cocktails I have ever had.\nThe beauty was they tailored the drinks to my requirements.\nThe 2 drinks I had were the Mojito and the Manhattan , both drinks were made to perfection and they both hit the spot on a warm Saigon night.\nThanks guys, I look forward to my return visit tonight, to take in the live music.\nRead more\nWritten August 11, 2023\nThe 6ix\nWow thank you so much for your kind words. We are really so grateful, and so happy you had a good time with us!\nWritten August 13, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
